#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:234
msgid ""
"The one copy escape hatch is `bytes.clone()` — a fresh buffer with the same "
"octets. There is no generic copy for any other type; if you need a divergent "
"value, build a new one."
msgstr ""

#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:238
msgid ""
"Absence is `nil` on a nullable `?T` — see [errors and "
"optionality](errors.md)."
