#: src/examples/01-sort.md:3
msgid ""
"The second runnable host example, in the shape of [00 — "
"Todolist](00-todolist.md): five sorting algorithms in rut — insertion, "
"bubble, and selection (loop-shaped), plus quicksort and merge sort "
