#: src/reference/host-futures.md:124
msgid "// drain + poll + drain\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/host-futures.md:129
msgid ""
"`run_ready()` drains the ready queue, polls the parked host futures (each "
"poll runs the `__yield` probe; a ready one is driven through `__take` and "
"its awaiter re-enqueued), then drains again — one pass settles a completed "
"host future end to end. `vm.pending_tasks()` counts ready frames, armed "
"timers, and the host-pending set, so a worker that never completes keeps the "
"loop alive — the flip side of best-effort cancellation."
msgstr ""

