#: src/reference/stdlib.md:19
msgid ""
"The builtin fns, primitives, and containers are in scope in every "
"compilation unit; no `use` is needed. A `use core::{ … };` statement stays "
"legal but is redundant for them. The exceptions — the **import-gated** "
"spellings, resolving only through `use core::{ .. }`: the const `NAN`, the "
"disposal context `DisposalContext`, the weak reference `Weak<T>`, and the "
"closed async pair (`Future<T>`, `RunContext`) — the engine's weave itself "
