"The `rut` binary is the toolchain's command-line face. It is also a **full "
"host**: running a program walks its directory, offers the tree packages its "
"surface names, binds the standard native bodies, and drives the async loop — "
"the same contract an embedded host implements ([embedding and native "
"modules](embedding.md))."
