"It is the **temporary-run** lane: running module directories and bundles, "
"`fmt`, `dump`, `pack`. The intended consumption path is depending on the "
"engine crates from your own project through a Cargo git dependency "
"([installation](../quick-start/installation.md)) and embedding the VM "
"([embedding and native modules](embedding.md)) — this page documents the "
"binary itself."
msgstr ""

